{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello everyone, welcome back to my channel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3366,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm Angela."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5100,
    "dDurationMs": 1133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How are you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6366,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm back again!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8100,
    "dDurationMs": 1433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In today's video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9533,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", I want to talk about a lighthearted topic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 13933,
    "dDurationMs": 6233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and introduce a really fun internet slang term: \"From Strong to La.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21566,
    "dDurationMs": 2334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This term is relatively new,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24266,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it seems to have only emerged last year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27366,
    "dDurationMs": 3267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", but it's incredibly popular in China now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31100,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ". If you frequently browse Chinese social media"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35133,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", watch short videos on platforms"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37700,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Xiaohongshu or Douyin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40900,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you've definitely seen this term."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44266,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What does \"From Strong to La\" actually mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47733,
    "dDurationMs": 7733,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a popular way of evaluating things among young Chinese people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56433,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like rating something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59266,
    "dDurationMs": 2867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "However, instead of using numerical ratings, it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62233,
    "dDurationMs": 7533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "uses several very strange and interesting words to rate things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69766,
    "dDurationMs": 9867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a very interesting and fun way of expressing evaluation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80366,
    "dDurationMs": 2467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or ranking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83366,
    "dDurationMs": 3367,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "things from strong to weak, from good to bad. \"From Strong to La\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86966,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "divides things into five levels from \"best\" to \"worst,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92300,
    "dDurationMs": 6866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and uses five very strange and interesting words to represent these five levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99266,
    "dDurationMs": 5667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The first level is... The first level is \"夯\" (hāng), which means the best, the most awesome, the most powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105000,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The second level is \"Top-tier,\" which means very good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 109633,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "slightly worse than \"夯\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112100,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but still very good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113933,
    "dDurationMs": 6133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third level is \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120133,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Superior Person,\" which means okay, alright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123533,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth level is \"NPC,\" which means very ordinary."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126500,
    "dDurationMs": 6433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The last level is \"Pull,\" or \"Pulled to the end,\" which means the worst."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133566,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reason this evaluation method is so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139266,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "popular now is because these five words are very interesting and very strange."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145566,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let's see where these five words come from and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150100,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why we use these five words to represent different levels."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154900,
    "dDurationMs": 2466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's look at the highest level - \"夯"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157533,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\" (hāng). The character is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 159766,
    "dDurationMs": 3334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"大\" (dà) on top and \"力\" (lì) on the bottom."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163233,
    "dDurationMs": 6700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its original meaning is: before building a house, first tamping the ground solid."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169933,
    "dDurationMs": 7567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before building a house, first use a very heavy tool to tamp the ground solid before"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177733,
    "dDurationMs": 1333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "building the house."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179433,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"夯\" (hāng) means this tool"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182300,
    "dDurationMs": 3666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has great strength, so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186333,
    "dDurationMs": 2967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it means great power. Great power means great strength, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189500,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191300,
    "dDurationMs": 3466,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that in Taiwanese dialects, \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194866,
    "dDurationMs": 7234,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "夯\" (hāng) means... The word \"夯\" (hāng) means very popular or well-received."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202233,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, in this evaluation system, \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204733,
    "dDurationMs": 6667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "夯\" signifies the best, the most outstanding, the most impressive, or the most powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211633,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Young people in China especially love using \"夯\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216566,
    "dDurationMs": 3534,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to describe something as top-notch, fantastic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220200,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", or to praise something as incredibly impressive or powerful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224700,
    "dDurationMs": 4133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example: \"这个奶茶店的奶茶太夯了\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228966,
    "dDurationMs": 3734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means the milk tea at this milk tea shop is so delicious"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232700,
    "dDurationMs": 866,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233566,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "best it's ever had."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235333,
    "dDurationMs": 3767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or, \"这个电影我看三次"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239133,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "这演员的演员作用太夯了\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241933,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means the actor's performance was amazing and incredible. \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245966,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "哎哟你的中文只是太夯了\" means your Chinese is so good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248533,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'll give you a \"夯\" (a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251466,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high rating)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253666,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are some of the more common uses of \"夯"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258433,
    "dDurationMs": 3467,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\": \"太夯了\" ( too popular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262233,
    "dDurationMs": 4067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "), \"夯爆了\" (so popular!), \"给一个夯\" (give you a \"夯\") – these are all common expressions for \"夯\". \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266500,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "夯\" can describe all sorts of things,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269700,
    "dDurationMs": 10066,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "such as food, restaurants, clothes, movies, music, games, etc."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279866,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you think something is the best,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282133,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can use \"夯\" to describe it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285266,
    "dDurationMs": 3634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ". Let's look at the second level - Top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289100,
    "dDurationMs": 3433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ". What does \"Top\" mean in Chinese?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292700,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Top\" means the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296066,
    "dDurationMs": 2567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "top of one's head, the highest point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298633,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, Top means the highest level ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302500,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304066,
    "dDurationMs": 5834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "athletes participating in the Olympics are all Top athletes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310100,
    "dDurationMs": 3566,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In our evaluation system, Top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313866,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means very good, very impressive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318333,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but slightly worse than \"Heng\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321233,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If \"Heng\" is 100 points,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323233,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Top represents 90 points."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326433,
    "dDurationMs": 2267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The third level is \"Ren Shang"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328766,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ren\" (人上人). \" Ren Shang Ren\" means someone above ordinary people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332833,
    "dDurationMs": 2833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", slightly better than ordinary people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336533,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exceeding the average level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339033,
    "dDurationMs": 4867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ". The term \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344100,
    "dDurationMs": 7533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ren Shang Ren\" comes from a Chinese proverb: \"Only by enduring hardship can one become a Ren Shang Ren.\" It means that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351833,
    "dDurationMs": 4267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can only become better than others"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356466,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you endure more hardship"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 359333,
    "dDurationMs": 3833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make more efforts than others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363633,
    "dDurationMs": 2433,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this evaluation system, \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366066,
    "dDurationMs": 2067,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": " "
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368166,
    "dDurationMs": 6134,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ren Shang Ren\" means slightly better than ordinary, okay, or pretty good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374700,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The fourth level is NPC,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378333,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is an abbreviation for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381766,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "non- player character in a game."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384900,
    "dDurationMs": 2166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Character\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387366,
    "dDurationMs": 4834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "refers to the background characters in a game;"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392233,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "nobody pays attention to them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395133,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or interacts with them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398300,
    "dDurationMs": 5833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Therefore, an NPC represents a very ordinary person, someone nobody notices."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404433,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this rating system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406933,
    "dDurationMs": 1933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it represents \"ordinary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409333,
    "dDurationMs": 8100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ",\" and the last, worst level is \"completely terrible.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417466,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The word \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419066,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "terrible \" comes from a dialect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424300,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in Northeast China"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426500,
    "dDurationMs": 3166,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "called \"lakua,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429900,
    "dDurationMs": 3233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning extremely bad or awful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433133,
    "dDurationMs": 2933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, \"This person is too terrible \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436233,
    "dDurationMs": 2033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "means this person is very bad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 438266,
    "dDurationMs": 3434,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", perhaps incompetent or of poor character—"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441700,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in short, not good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443766,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ". Another example is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445266,
    "dDurationMs": 2734,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"This matter you handled was too terrible, \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448033,
    "dDurationMs": 4633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning your handling of this matter was... If something wasn't done well or wasn't completed well"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452866,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", then in this evaluation system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456166,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"la\" is used to indicate something very bad."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459333,
    "dDurationMs": 7933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"La wan le\" means it couldn't be worse, the worst, the absolute worst, and couldn't be any worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467333,
    "dDurationMs": 5633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Young people today especially love using \"la\" to describe"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473133,
    "dDurationMs": 2233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or evaluate things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475766,
    "dDurationMs": 3667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example: \"The movie I watched today was so la"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479700,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", I left halfway through,\" or \"It was so boring,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483066,
    "dDurationMs": 4967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or \"Oh, this restaurant is so la, expensive and terrible. \" \""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 488033,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "La\" can be used alone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489866,
    "dDurationMs": 1867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ", or you can say \"La wan le.\" \"La wan le"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491866,
    "dDurationMs": 1267,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\" means very bad,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493133,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even worse than \"la,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495333,
    "dDurationMs": 1567,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can't be any worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497066,
    "dDurationMs": 3967,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, \"Oh, my exam was 'la wan le,' I'm definitely going to fail"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501166,
    "dDurationMs": 4300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": ",\" meaning I did terribly on the exam, and couldn't be any worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 505500,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's the usage of \"la\" and \"la wan le."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 508966,
    "dDurationMs": 7334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\" This evaluation method, from \"han\" to \"la,\" isn't actually a single... A very serious evaluation method"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516533,
    "dDurationMs": 2733,
    "segs": [ {
